  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Season of Giving 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Your donation will help Red Cross support the most vulnerable people in our local communities, here in Australia &amp; across the Asia Pacific. Right now, Red Cross teams are on the ground helping thousands of people affected by disaster, conflict &amp; other crises. From flood-affected towns in the south east, to the remote communities of our Top End, to the armed conflict in Eastern Europe, we are there. People helping people, no matter what, to find safety, opportunity &amp; friendship in a crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
